くあります。データが取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(22年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"83.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"14.0\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,12.8 9.1,16.4 14.2,31.4 19.3,30.5 24.5,36.4 29.6,34.6 34.7,45.5 39.8,48.6 44.9,76.3 50.0,73.6 55.1,85.9 60.3,79.1 65.4,84.5 70.5,85.9 75.6,77.7 80.7,78.6 85.8,75.4 91.0,73.6 96.1,60.9 101.2,62.7 106.3,69.1 111.4,80.0 116.5,66.8 121.6,60.9 126.8,15.5 131.9,28.7 137.0,16.4 142.1,17.3 147.2,25.5 152.3,35.5 157.4,44.6 162.6,52.7 167.7,44.6 172.8,36.4 177.9,37.7 183.0,37.3 188.1,53.2 193.2,53.6 198.4,49.1 203.5,56.8 208.6,69.5 213.7,66.4 218.8,79.5 223.9,70.4 229.0,62.7 234.2,61.4 239.3,55.5 244.4,58.2 249.5,55.0 254.6,58.2 259.7,59.1 264.9,59.5 270.0,57.3 275.1,65.0 280.2,60.5 285.3,66.8 290.4,55.5 295.5,50.0 300.7,59.1 305.8,62.3 310.9,62.7 316.0,61.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 55.1 97.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 70.5 97.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 111.4 92.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 218.8 91.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"3